le_refs"},{"basis":"authored_atlas_row","component_id":"verifier_lab_kernel","ref_kind":"principle","source_ref":"core/organ_atlas.json::organs[verifier_lab_kernel].principle_refs"},{"basis":"authored_atlas_row","component_id":"world_model_projection_drift_control_room","ref_kind":"principle","source_ref":"core/organ_atlas.json::organs[world_model_projection_drift_control_room].principle_refs"}],"cited_by_count":32,"component_ids":["bounded_autonomy_campaign_packet","bridge_phase_continuity_runtime","cognitive_operator_registry","cold_reader_route_map","concurrency_mission_control","corpus_readiness_mathlib_absence_gate","engine_room_demo","finance_forecast_evaluation_spine","formal_evidence_cell_anchor_resolver","formal_math_premise_retrieval","formal_math_readiness_gate","formal_math_verifier_trace_repair_loop","lean_std_premise_index","materials_chemistry_closed_loop_lab_safety_replay","mathematical_strategy_atlas_hypothesis_scorer","navigation_hologram_route_plane","pattern_assimilation_step","pattern_binding_contract","prediction_oracle_reconciliation","proof_diagnostic_evidence_spine","provider_context_recipe_budget_policy","public_reveal_walkthrough","research_replication_rubric_artifact_replay","ring2_premise_retrieval_precision_recall_harness","routing_anti_patterns_registry","spatial_world_model_counterfactual_simulation_replay","tactic_portfolio_availability_probe","target_shape_tactic_routing_gate","undeclared_library_prior_symbol_classifier","verifier_lab_execution_spine","verifier_lab_kernel","world_model_projection_drift_control_room"],"exposed_count":0,"exposure":[],"failure_modes":[],"id":"P-8","kind":"principle","plain":"When a precondition fails, return a refusal that gives the reason. Never emit a meaningless statistic, a proof status, a safety verdict or a public-readiness status just to keep a pipeline green.","principles":[],"reader":{"analogy":{"boundary":"The pharmacy picture covers withholding an unfounded answer; it does not say whether the original request was valid.","maps":[{"analogy":"the pharmacist dispenses only a complete, valid prescription","doctrine":"an Ok result only when the precondition holds"},{"analogy":"an incomplete prescription comes back with the missing detail noted on it","doctrine":"a failed precondition returns a refusal with its reason and evidence"},{"analogy":"the pharmacist does not invent a dose to avoid sending the patient away empty-handed","doctrine":"no meaningless value just to keep the run green"}],"text":"A pharmacist missing a required detail on a prescription hands it back with the reason written on it, instead of guessing a dose to send the patient away with a filled bottle."},"basis":"authored_reader_enrichment","counterexample":"A readiness gate reports a corpus as available and shows green while the library it needs is missing.","does_not_prove":"A refusal records that an answer was withheld and why; whether the refusal itself was correct is a separate question.","enforced_in_component_ids":["finance_forecast_evaluation_spine","corpus_readiness_mathlib_absence_gate"],"example":{"component_ids":["finance_forecast_evaluation_spine"],"text":"The finance forecast evaluation spine returns a typed refusal when the forecast horizon reaches or exceeds the sample size, or when the statistics library is unavailable, instead of reporting a loss difference the data cannot support."},"governs":"What a computation returns when it cannot run properly.","plain":"When a step cannot be done properly because something it needs is missing, it should hand back a clear refusal that says why, instead of a made-up answer that makes the work look finished.","potential_misread":"That some number is always better than none, even when nothing supports that number.","refuses":"Producing a meaningless statistic, proof verdict, safety verdict or readiness status to keep the run green when the inputs do not support one.","requires":"An Ok result only when the declared precondition holds, and otherwise a refusal with a reason and evidence.","source_ref":"core/doctrine_enrichment.json","why_it_matters":"It stops a system from reporting a forecast past its data, or a ready flag while a needed part is missing, just to avoid showing red."},"rests_on":["AX-7"],"source_ref":"PRINCIPLES.md::P-8","statement":"Grounding: AX-7.\nObligation grounding: AX-7.O1.ok_under_precondition, AX-7.O2.refusal_carries_reason_evidence, AX-7.O3.absent_library_refuses_not_overclaims.\n\nWhen a precondition fails, return a refusal that gives the reason. Never emit a\nmeaningless statistic, a proof status, a safety verdict or a public-readiness\nstatus just to keep a pipeline green.","statement_sha256":"cc91d43977dda317bca154bfb27844a285b06a9b0585758fbdda74790c71ff22","title":"Refuse inadmissible computations with typed reasons","violates":[]},"schema_version":"plectis_component_http_v1","snapshot_revision":"45be1deb333ad57cd9ae093229455d0a52d3bf23a9064cde09f1a6e16f4c7044"}